@@@ colo-placeholder
type: html_page
title: Lighthouse Network — temporarily offline
author: sysop_ray
date: 1999-10-18T23:10:00-07:00
path: /colo/index.html
role: critical
---
<html>
<head><title>Lighthouse Network - temporarily offline</title></head>
<body bgcolor="#ffffff" text="#000000">
<h2>We'll be right back.</h2>
<p>The Lighthouse Network moved to a new server this weekend and the move did not go well. We are working on restoring the forum and the Log Book.</p>
<p>The guestbook still works: <a href="/guestbook/">sign it</a> so we know you're out there.</p>
<p>&mdash; Ray</p>
<img src="/img/construction.gif" alt="UNDER CONSTRUCTION">
</body>
</html>

